        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "idea-template"
        },
        "markdown": "## Use the graph as an argument\n\nKeep **Idea**, **Problem**, **Audience**, and **Proposed Approach** as singular anchors. Duplicate **Question**, **Assumption**, **Research**, **Evidence**, **Alternative**, **Risk**, and **Next Step** as the investigation grows.\n\nEvidence should support or contradict something specific. Next steps should test an assumption or question and name the evidence they are expected to produce.\n\nSee the adjacent `SKILL.md` before deriving a new graph."
      },
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 210
        },
